.TH VIBEMDM 8 "October 2026" "VibeMDM" "System Manager's Manual"
.SH NAME
vibemdm \- self-hosted Apple MDM server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibemdm
.br
.B vibemdm version
.br
.B vibemdm rotate\-encryption\-key
.br
.B vibemdm help
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vibemdm
is the VibeMDM server: an Apple MDM (built on NanoMDM) with a SCEP CA,
APNs push, Declarative Device Management, an agent API, a web console and REST
API, compliance (mSCP), health checks and an MCP server for AI agents. It is
configured entirely through environment variables and stores its state in
PostgreSQL. Database migrations run automatically at start-up.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B vibemdm
Run the server.
.TP
.B version
Print the version.
.TP
.B rotate\-encryption\-key
Re-encrypt stored secrets from
.B VIBEMDM_ENCRYPTION_KEY_OLD
to
.B VIBEMDM_ENCRYPTION_KEY
in one transaction. Stop the server first. Nothing changes if the old key is wrong.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_DATABASE_URL
PostgreSQL connection URL (required).
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_SERVER_URL
Public https URL devices use (e.g. https://mdm.example.com).
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_LISTEN
Listen address (default :8080).
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_DATA_DIR
Data directory for log archives and diagnostics (default /data).
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_ASSETS_DIR
Directory for uploaded packages, the agent package and Mac App icons (default: the data directory).
Files an older version kept in the data directory are moved here at start-up.
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_AGENT_DIR
Directory with prebuilt agent binaries (default /app/agents).
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_ADMIN_PASSWORD
First-boot admin password (12+ characters; empty generates one, saved to
DATA_DIR/initial-admin-password). Must be changed at first login.
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_ENCRYPTION_KEY
Passphrase for at-rest encryption of private keys and FileVault keys. Back it up.
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_TRUSTED_PROXIES
Comma-separated CIDRs/IPs allowed to set X-Forwarded-For.
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_ALLOW_HTTP
Set to 1 to allow a plain http server URL (isolated labs only).
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_SESSION_TTL_HOURS
Console session lifetime (default 168).
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_LOG_DB_LEVEL
Minimum level stored in the searchable log table (debug, info, warn, error).
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_DEBUG\fR, \fBVIBEMDM_DUMP_MDM
Verbose logging; dump raw MDM traffic to stdout (debugging only: includes secrets).
.TP
.B VIBEMDM_APNS_URL
Alternate APNs endpoint (testing).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I DATA_DIR/initial\-admin\-password
Generated bootstrap password (mode 0600); delete after the first login.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vibemdm\-agent (8)
.PP
docs/manual/ and docs/security.md in the source tree.
